1
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:22,656
(Silence; Operating Room Area)

2
00:00:39,610 --> 00:00:43,536
=Stand Up for Love=

3
00:00:43,728 --> 00:00:46,656
=Episode 21=

4
00:00:53,840 --> 00:00:54,920
Zhang Haotian isn't here.

5
00:00:55,039 --> 00:00:55,679
Please leave.

6
00:00:56,399 --> 00:00:57,359
I'm here to see you.

7
00:00:58,119 --> 00:00:59,119
Haotian asked me

8
00:00:59,679 --> 00:01:01,280
to take you to the hospital
for a checkup.

9
00:01:02,520 --> 00:01:03,759
A minor illness shouldn't be ignored.

10
00:01:04,719 --> 00:01:05,640
You may die.

11
00:01:08,959 --> 00:01:09,719
Die?

12
00:01:12,239 --> 00:01:13,280
How scary.

13
00:01:14,400 --> 00:01:16,640
But since you mean well,

14
00:01:17,799 --> 00:01:18,719
I'll accept your kindness.

15
00:01:28,120 --> 00:01:28,920
Hi.

16
00:01:30,040 --> 00:01:31,560
Ms. Shen, what brings you to my place?

17
00:01:31,879 --> 00:01:33,519
Mr. Zhang,
you haven't replied to my messages.

18
00:01:33,799 --> 00:01:35,159
I'm a little worried.

19
00:01:35,879 --> 00:01:36,519
Is that so?

20
00:01:41,040 --> 00:01:42,159
I have been busy lately.

21
00:01:42,359 --> 00:01:43,560
Maybe I missed them.

22
00:01:44,840 --> 00:01:45,760
What can I do for you?

23
00:01:46,719 --> 00:01:47,519
Here's the thing.

24
00:01:48,840 --> 00:01:49,879
Our company

25
00:01:49,879 --> 00:01:51,519
has recently expanded overseas,

26
00:01:51,680 --> 00:01:52,719
and we need funds urgently.

27
00:01:54,159 --> 00:01:55,159
Tomorrow is the 8th,

28
00:01:55,359 --> 00:01:56,400
our agreed payout date.

29
00:01:57,280 --> 00:01:58,359
Besides the returns,

30
00:01:58,840 --> 00:02:00,519
I'd like to withdraw my principal
as well.

31
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:04,120
Sure, sure.

32
00:02:04,560 --> 00:02:05,359
No problem.

33
00:02:05,359 --> 00:02:06,760
I'll arrange it right away.

34
00:02:07,560 --> 00:02:09,199
I'll wait for your update, Mr. Zhang.

35
00:02:26,479 --> 00:02:27,120
Ms. Wang.

36
00:02:29,800 --> 00:02:30,919
It's nothing serious.

37
00:02:31,120 --> 00:02:33,400
The payout date is coming up
on the 10th.

38
00:02:34,240 --> 00:02:37,039
I need some cash urgently.

39
00:02:37,319 --> 00:02:38,879
About your returns...

40
00:02:38,879 --> 00:02:40,080
Could we maybe

41
00:02:40,800 --> 00:02:42,520
settle them together next month?

42
00:02:42,520 --> 00:02:43,479
Mr. Zhang,

43
00:02:43,599 --> 00:02:45,360
my funds are tight too.

44
00:02:45,680 --> 00:02:46,479
How about this?

45
00:02:46,680 --> 00:02:47,960
Forget the returns for now.

46
00:02:48,280 --> 00:02:50,199
I'll just take back my principal first.

47
00:02:51,479 --> 00:02:52,159
Well...

48
00:02:54,479 --> 00:02:54,879
Sure.

49
00:02:55,520 --> 00:02:56,240
No problem.

50
00:02:59,240 --> 00:03:00,599
(The heiress of the Lin Group,)

51
00:03:00,639 --> 00:03:03,159
(whose husband Zhang Haotian's company)

52
00:03:03,199 --> 00:03:04,879
(has been exposed in a fraud scandal.)

53
00:03:05,680 --> 00:03:06,199
Babe.

54
00:03:08,759 --> 00:03:09,439
Honey.

55
00:03:09,840 --> 00:03:10,840
That's hilarious.

56
00:03:11,479 --> 00:03:12,919
Someone actually accused you of fraud.

57
00:03:18,719 --> 00:03:20,360
The man I chose

58
00:03:20,680 --> 00:03:22,360
could never be a fraudster.

59
00:03:24,680 --> 00:03:25,240
Babe,

60
00:03:26,159 --> 00:03:26,960
this is just a dirty trick

61
00:03:26,960 --> 00:03:28,919
by my competitors to take me down.

62
00:03:29,960 --> 00:03:31,520
They cut off my funding.

63
00:03:33,080 --> 00:03:33,639
I...

64
00:03:35,280 --> 00:03:36,319
How much do you need?

65
00:03:38,960 --> 00:03:39,479
You've already

66
00:03:39,479 --> 00:03:40,719
spent so much on me.

67
00:03:41,400 --> 00:03:42,560
Shouldn't I

68
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:44,199
help you out?

69
00:03:49,599 --> 00:03:50,400
Five hundred million.

70
00:03:50,520 --> 00:03:51,680
That's all? Only five hundred million?

71
00:03:51,879 --> 00:03:53,159
I'll transfer it right away.

72
00:03:57,879 --> 00:03:58,840
Thank you, darling.

73
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:26,439
Give me your phone.

74
00:04:29,040 --> 00:04:30,759
You brought me here
for a checkup yourself.

75
00:04:30,759 --> 00:04:32,839
Dr. Chen, you really care about me.

76
00:04:33,879 --> 00:04:35,040
Haotian is like my brother.

77
00:04:35,680 --> 00:04:37,600
I've never seen him care
about a woman this much.

78
00:04:38,839 --> 00:04:39,600
Ms. Zhao,

79
00:04:40,279 --> 00:04:42,120
your health affects his happiness.

80
00:04:42,879 --> 00:04:43,839
I have to care.

81
00:04:47,040 --> 00:04:47,680
Is that so?

82
00:04:48,279 --> 00:04:50,360
But why do I feel like

83
00:04:50,560 --> 00:04:52,360
you're a little nervous?

84
00:04:52,959 --> 00:04:54,000
Could it be that you did

85
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:55,480
something guilty to me before?

86
00:04:58,040 --> 00:04:59,439
Ms. Zhao, you do have a sense of humor.

87
00:05:17,040 --> 00:05:18,199
(One kidney.)

88
00:05:18,600 --> 00:05:20,399
(Zhao Ke has only one kidney.)

89
00:05:20,600 --> 00:05:21,240
(No...)

90
00:05:21,519 --> 00:05:22,959
(She isn't Zhao Ke.)

91
00:05:23,160 --> 00:05:25,120
(She... she's Jiang Lai.)

92
00:05:25,360 --> 00:05:26,480
(How is that possible?)

93
00:05:26,920 --> 00:05:28,800
(Her records were canceled.
She was cremated.)

94
00:05:29,279 --> 00:05:31,079
(How could she still be alive?)

95
00:05:31,879 --> 00:05:32,399
(It's over.)

96
00:05:33,000 --> 00:05:35,040
(We've all been fooled by her.)

97
00:05:39,360 --> 00:05:39,839
Hello?

98
00:05:40,360 --> 00:05:41,560
Why are you answering the phone?

99
00:05:41,839 --> 00:05:42,519
Where's Ke?

100
00:05:47,680 --> 00:05:49,079
Zhao Ke only has one kidney.

101
00:05:49,560 --> 00:05:50,720
You took her for a checkup?

102
00:05:50,839 --> 00:05:52,199
Haotian, I can't tell you much
right now.

103
00:05:52,680 --> 00:05:54,439
I need to run further tests on her.

104
00:05:54,439 --> 00:05:56,480
I need to confirm when her surgery
was performed.

105
00:05:56,639 --> 00:05:57,360
Don't.

106
00:05:57,839 --> 00:05:58,399
Haotian,

107
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:00,639
only by confirming
whether she's Jiang Lai

108
00:06:00,639 --> 00:06:01,959
can you continue living happily, right?

109
00:06:01,959 --> 00:06:02,839
She's Zhao Ke.

110
00:06:02,839 --> 00:06:04,040
She's the daughter of my
adoptive father, Zhang Yongren.

111
00:06:04,040 --> 00:06:05,079
Are you fu...?

112
00:06:05,839 --> 00:06:07,000
Are you deaf?

113
00:06:09,839 --> 00:06:10,480
Don't do it.

114
00:06:11,360 --> 00:06:13,439
We've already lost
the Lin family's money.

115
00:06:13,439 --> 00:06:15,000
We can't risk going to prison again.

116
00:06:15,160 --> 00:06:15,720
Chen Ping.

117
00:06:15,720 --> 00:06:17,240
I can't listen to you this time.

118
00:06:17,439 --> 00:06:18,079
Chen Ping!

119
00:06:24,439 --> 00:06:25,279
(This is bad.)

120
00:06:26,080 --> 00:06:28,040
(Another Blow)

121
00:06:28,672 --> 00:06:33,570
♪Listen, the wind chimes softly whisper♪

122
00:06:33,856 --> 00:06:37,270
♪I should forget you♪

123
00:06:37,352 --> 00:06:42,200
♪But I have the will,
yet not the strength♪

124
00:06:42,280 --> 00:06:44,344
♪To carry on♪

125
00:06:44,400 --> 00:06:49,832
♪The scenery you once longed to see♪

126
00:06:49,896 --> 00:06:52,310
♪You no longer have the strength♪

127
00:06:53,824 --> 00:06:56,840
♪You want me to go there for you♪

128
00:06:58,336 --> 00:07:03,800
♪I look up and see a hollow sky♪

129
00:07:04,416 --> 00:07:07,800
♪Your freedom♪

130
00:07:07,856 --> 00:07:12,870
♪Has become my cage♪

131
00:07:13,424 --> 00:07:20,390
♪My hand brushes over your smile
in the photograph♪

132
00:07:20,576 --> 00:07:25,940
♪This glass of wine is filled
with sorrow♪

133
00:07:26,736 --> 00:07:32,820
♪I look up at the beautiful night sky♪

134
00:07:33,040 --> 00:07:37,792
♪You told me♪

135
00:07:37,840 --> 00:07:42,090
♪I would shine like a star♪

136
00:07:42,176 --> 00:07:45,160
♪But you forgot to teach me♪

137
00:07:45,536 --> 00:07:50,250
♪How to live without you♪

138
00:07:50,710 --> 00:07:56,456
♪I look up at the starry sky♪

139
00:07:57,864 --> 00:08:00,960
♪So hazy and blurred♪
